{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-core":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-core/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/rem-mass-endomorphism-tower-phi-q-history","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Remark","doco:Section"],"label":"rem:mass-endomorphism-tower-phi-q-history","kind":"remark","title":"Why $\\mathrm{Li}_2^q$ replaced the Faddeev $\\Phi_q$ form in the mass tower","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-mass-endomorphism-tower"],"interprets":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-mass-endomorphism-tower","tags":["mass-tower","dilogarithm","comparison-with-measurement"],"text":"mass-endomorphism-tower-phi-q-history.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"rem:mass-endomorphism-tower-phi-q-history\"></a><p><strong>Choice of the <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code>-dilogarithm convention (<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathrm{Li}_2^q</code> versus <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\Phi_q</code>).</strong> In the <a href=\"#prop:mass-endomorphism-tower\" data-at=\"mass-theory/archimedean-realization-kashaev\">mass-endomorphism tower</a>, the series is resummed through the Jackson <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code>-dilogarithm <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathrm{Li}_2^q(z)</code> rather than the compact Faddeev function <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\Phi_q(z)</code>. Direct term-by-term <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code>-integration of the geometric series produces <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathrm{Li}_2^q(z)</code>, which preserves bar-involution isospin symmetry at the real substrate anchor <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q_0</code> and avoids the mirror-nucleus asymmetry poles introduced by the modular double ratio in <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\Phi_q</code>.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/mass-endomorphism-tower-phi-q-history.md","heading":"Remark","number":"13.15.9","page":"b/rem-mass-endomorphism-tower-phi-q-history"}
